in his own movie in order to&nbsp;
make himself look like an expert.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:43.920 --> 00:02:49.840
And and it was just like that's it&nbsp;
that's it I I have to talk about this now

00:03:07.680 --> 00:03:13.440
okay first things first the earth is not the&nbsp;
center of the universe i'm putting this at the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:13.440 --> 00:03:18.400
front because I don't want to have to debunk&nbsp;
every random ass claim the filmmakers toss&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:18.400 --> 00:03:21.920
out as they come up the folks who made&nbsp;
this film are going to make a number of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:21.920 --> 00:03:28.320
claims that are just wrong. We have in fact&nbsp;
demonstrated that the earth orbits the sun.

00:03:28.320 --> 00:03:33.280
Stellar parallax was first measured in the&nbsp;
1830s and has only gotten more precise since,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:33.280 --> 00:03:38.320
and lagrange point satellites behave the way&nbsp;
that they do because we accurately understand&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:38.320 --> 00:03:45.040
how gravity behaves on celestial objects; an&nbsp;
understanding that has enabled us to, for example,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:45.040 --> 00:03:53.200
