reality it's a lot more vague than that.

00:04:17.280 --> 00:04:23.680
Bottom line, geocentrism as a model of the cosmos&nbsp;
requires a universe where a series of incredibly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:23.680 --> 00:04:31.280
consistent physical principles apply to everything&nbsp;
else we can see except us. Now that's exactly what&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:31.280 --> 00:04:37.280
they're trying to imply but as with flat earth&nbsp;
this creates a cascade effect where successively&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:37.280 --> 00:04:43.440
more and more functional predictive science needs&nbsp;
to be discarded in order to make the claim work.

00:04:43.440 --> 00:04:48.720
