is the fulcrum of the universe then the stellar&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:54.720 --> 00:05:01.040
field needs to be moving at absurd speeds in&nbsp;
order to orbit the earth once every 24 hours,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:01.040 --> 00:05:07.680
speeds that would be detectable and relativistic.&nbsp;
