00:05:07.680 --> 00:05:13.360
it all just causes a cascade. And, again that&nbsp;
right there is exactly what they're claiming,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:13.360 --> 00:05:17.520
that they’ve found evidence that should&nbsp;
cause us to toss out relativity and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:17.520 --> 00:05:21.440
universal gravity and everything we've&nbsp;
discovered based on those principles&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:21.440 --> 00:05:26.640
because it disagrees with their model.&nbsp;
And since that isn't happening they claim&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:26.640 --> 00:05:38.320
there's a conspiracy that's suppressing&nbsp;
the evidence. And now on with the show.

