00:06:37.680 --> 00:06:40.480
"I have no recollection of being&nbsp;
interviewed for such a film,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:40.480 --> 00:06:44.160
and of course had I known of its&nbsp;
premise I would have refused. So,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:44.160 --> 00:06:48.560
either the producers used clips of me that were in&nbsp;
the public domain, or they bought them from other&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:48.560 --> 00:06:53.680
