00:29:51.280 --> 00:29:55.280
But to do that you need to launder a few things.

00:29:55.280 --> 00:30:00.960
So this is how you scrub the ideas. You don’t&nbsp;
say “we’re making a movie proving that the earth&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:00.960 --> 00:30:07.360
is the center of the universe.” You say “we’re&nbsp;
making a movie about changes in our understanding&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:30:07.360 --> 00:30:14.400
of the Copernican principle” or “we’re making a&nbsp;
movie about the history and future of cosmology.”

00:30:14.400 --> 00:30:17.760
there's just nothing about the&nbsp;
